    "detailed_description": "Take on the role of the spoilt sole heir to a once powerful industrial family and, after the death of your grandfather, take over the fortunes of a weapons manufacturer whose history lies hidden in the trials and tribulations of the 1940s. The great prosperity has long since been lost and only crumbs of past wealth still exist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo you have practically nothing left of your grandfather Wilhelm Werner Werner except the ownership of &quot;Werner Waffenwerke&quot;, a few million dollars, a small branch of the once mighty company in a small European country and his much-loved mascot &quot;Werner Wombat&quot;. Your task is extremely difficult: lead the company back to its place in the sun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA variety of challenges await you:<br />\r\n*Design your own weapons and research new technologies<br />\r\n*Build new factories and research facilities<br />\r\n*Sell your weapons in various ways to numerous interested parties<br />\r\n*Manage the company through the many aspects of day-to-day operations<br />\r\n*Become the most valuable company in the world and become the richest person of all time<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe project is being developed by me as the sole developer and I am therefore very happy to receive feedback and ideas. At one point or another I may already be a bit blinded by my work and will be grateful for your comments.",
    "about_the_game": "Take on the role of the spoilt sole heir to a once powerful industrial family and, after the death of your grandfather, take over the fortunes of a weapons manufacturer whose history lies hidden in the trials and tribulations of the 1940s. The great prosperity has long since been lost and only crumbs of past wealth still exist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo you have practically nothing left of your grandfather Wilhelm Werner Werner except the ownership of &quot;Werner Waffenwerke&quot;, a few million dollars, a small branch of the once mighty company in a small European country and his much-loved mascot &quot;Werner Wombat&quot;. Your task is extremely difficult: lead the company back to its place in the sun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA variety of challenges await you:<br />\r\n*Design your own weapons and research new technologies<br />\r\n*Build new factories and research facilities<br />\r\n*Sell your weapons in various ways to numerous interested parties<br />\r\n*Manage the company through the many aspects of day-to-day operations<br />\r\n*Become the most valuable company in the world and become the richest person of all time<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe project is being developed by me as the sole developer and I am therefore very happy to receive feedback and ideas. At one point or another I may already be a bit blinded by my work and will be grateful for your comments.",
